       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Edit Appearance for Weapon & Shield Attachments",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With the addition of the new Dark Odyssey weapon attachments and shield rönd in the patch, we have added the ability to use the ‘Edit Appearance’ feature on those components of Kratos’ arsenal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You’ll be able to pick whatever visual suits your look with the functionality you want for your build!",
